      <unicode>ᠳᠠᠶᠢᠯᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>deyilekü</uighur>
      <definition>To overcome, to defeat. To subjugate, to get the upper hand, to overthrow. Falling in of a horse's belly</definition>
